	quest.1F9E4A01813AC470.quest_desc: [
		"Did you ever wonder how a Fission Reactor generates power? You probably thought it would do fancy things to extract energy from atoms, but no. It heats water which we put through a Steam Turbine..."
		""
		"Time to make a Steam Turbine!"
	]
