	quest.20C0D53BF4EC773C.title: "Grand Reward"
	quest.20C6F6AA94330718.quest_desc: [
		"You will need to use a &bConfigurator&r and shift+right-click into the reactor ports to change their modes. You will need to put &aFissile Fuel&r and Coolant into the reactor and you will get &2Nuclear Waste&r and &6Heated Coolant&r as outputs. There are different options for coolants (check JEI) but usually water is enough. You can use a sink to get infinite water. You can right click the reactor and press activate after you prepare every input and output. You should use the &bConfigurator&r to manage mekanisms pipes."
		"&cDO NOT ACTIVATE THE REACTOR IF YOU DIDN'T CONNECT THE OUTPUTS&r"
		"&cUSE MEKANISMS PIPES &r"
	]
