	quest.3556B2FF4EA2ABE8.quest_desc: [
		"In vanilla Minecraft, there’s a small bug where the world loads and starts running before the player has control or vision. This doesn’t usually cause any problems in vanilla since it’s a quick process, but mods can slow it down, which can lead to deaths during the loading screen."
		""
		"To help with this, we added an invincibility period during and after world load and dimension change. However, since loading times can vary, this might not always be enough. To stay safe, it’s best to log off in a secure spot where mobs can’t reach you"
	]
	quest.3556B2FF4EA2ABE8.quest_subtitle: "I know this is a lot to read but it is important."
	quest.3562C9A9287AFBD5.quest_desc: ["Look up!"]
	quest.3562C9A9287AFBD5.title: "Find The Heavenly Challenger"
	quest.35A5E41BDB8A6231.quest_desc: ["As long as you have more than or equal to 10 full hearts, when you take lethal damage you won't instantly die. Instead, you'll be left with half a heart. No more losing your worlds to random creepers."]
	quest.35A5E41BDB8A6231.title: "Instadeath Protection"
	quest.370E2E70A6219BED.quest_desc: ["The very first step to every minecraft world."]
	quest.370E2E70A6219BED.title: "The First Step"
	quest.370F3020E617D206.quest_desc: [
		"So it finally happened. Well, what are you going to do now?"
		""
		"Are you going to start a new world, quit for good or will you enable cheats and continue playing?"
		""
		"I won't judge you if you are going to cheat. This is a video game after all and it exists for you to enjoy."
		""
		"You can also disable hardcore world generation with configs. Look at the modpack page for more info."
	]
