	quest.7CD4394153BF9AB0.title: "Forest"
	quest.7DD77FB319A16E95.quest_desc: ["You can make multi-block Energy Cells to store huge amounts of energy. Make a cube out of Induction Casing, put Structural Glass or Input/Output Ports on the walls and fill inside with as much Cells and Providers as you want. More Cells means more storage, more Providers means faster input/output. You can change the Port's modes with the &bConfugirator&r. "]
	quest.7DD77FB319A16E95.title: "Advanced Energy Storage"
	quest.7E352D90B1AB6B32.quest_desc: [
		"Right-Click to the reactor and click into the I symbol. From there you can set the burn rate. Higher burn rates increase Coolant consumtion and Heated Coolant production. &4The reactor will overheat if you run out of Coolant.&r"
		""
		"If you change the burn rate and see your Coolant rapidly decrease do not panic, close the reactor (SCRAM button) and lower the burn rate. You can pump more coolant into the reactor by using more sinks as input or by using better pipes. Putting multiple input points to a singular sink does increase the coolant amount."
	]
